WEBVTT

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.976
and, you know, you should be
a dutiful daughter, not complain,

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:39.434
and it was the same way
I felt about being Asian.

00:08:39.458 --> 00:08:42.893
You know, like I feel
like there is a stereotype

00:08:42.917 --> 00:08:48.393
that Asians don't speak up
or ask for things or complain.

00:08:48.417 --> 00:08:49.726
AG: That's the bad news.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.309
Stereotypes can hold people back.

00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:56.226
The good news is that there's a way
to overcome these stereotypes.

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:57.726
Extensive evidence reveals

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:00.559
that when women negotiate
on behalf of others,